      "description": "Watch Ajax Amsterdam vs Heerenveen highlights and goals from Eredivisie on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 16, 2026. A battle of nerves in the Eredivisie On August 16, 2026, Ajax faced off against SC Heerenveen in a high-stakes Eredivisie encounter. With a crowd of 54,239 spectators watching, the match developed into a compelling tactical struggle as both sides fought for supremacy on the pitch. First half momentum Ajax set the tone early, taking the lead in the 7th minute courtesy of an own goal by Bernt Klaverboer . The momentum continued to favor the hosts when Abdellah Ouazane unleashed a powerful strike from outside the box in the 33rd minute, assisted by Caio Henrique , to double the advantage. Just as the game seemed to be slipping away from the visitors, SC Heerenveen mounted a response before the break; Jacob Trenskow found the net with his left foot in the 45th minute, set up by Sam Kersten , ensuring the match remained delicately poised going into the tunnel. Second half tactical struggle Following the restart, the match became an intense physical battle with both managers utilizing tactical substitutions to gain an edge. SC Heerenveen showed great character, culminating in an 82nd-minute equalizer from Maxence Rivera , who slotted home with his right foot. The dying minutes saw Ajax throw everything forward in pursuit of a winner, including late attempts from Marcos Leonardo and Caio Henrique , but the visiting defense held firm until the final whistle, concluding the match with a hard-fought draw."
